  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising reputational damage to firms involved in contested chip supply encourages whistleblowing, forced disclosures, and publicized investigations that raise the volume and timeliness of intelligence about Iran's acquisition channels.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">china_ai_chip_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_regional_conflict</data>
</edge>
