  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.55</data>
  <data key="d36">Higher investor risk perceptions can push firms toward short‑term revenue strategies including covert or higher‑risk maritime shipments to sanctioned buyers like Iran, increasing the frequency of seizures, interdictions and related maritime incidents.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">china_ai_chip_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_regional_conflict</data>
</edge>
