  <data key="d36">High-level summit engagement between Moscow and Washington/European capitals negotiated as part of Ukraine diplomacy can produce direct deconfliction agreements or hotlines that are then used to exchange timely incident reports and maritime warnings relevant to Iranian regional incidents, increasing actionable information flow to decision-makers.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_regional_conflict</data>
</edge>
