  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Clear and sustained consensus among major coalition partners reduces policy uncertainty about sanctions and assistance, lowering short‑term repricing events and implied/realized volatility in bond and other financial markets.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">global_bond_market_shock</data>
</edge>
