  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Stronger multilateral agreement drives coordinated cross-border enforcement actions (shared watchlists, joint port inspections and intelligence-sharing), causing a measurable rise in enforcement activity against sanctioned oil shipments even without immediate legal changes.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">global_oil_market_shift</data>
</edge>
