  <data key="d36">An increase in negotiation leverage for a major exporter (ability to withhold or redirect supplies) tightens available diesel supplies for some buyers and raises risk premia, widening diesel refined-product spreads versus crude benchmarks.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
