<edge source="russia_ukraine_war::military_supply_rate" target="global_bond_market_shock::long_term_bond_yield" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">A sustained uptick in military supply flows forces higher defense-related government spending and raises sovereign funding needs and term premia, prompting investors to demand higher long-term yields on government bonds.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">global_bond_market_shock</data>
</edge>
<edge source="russia_ukraine_war::military_supply_rate" target="global_oil_market_shift::shipping_capacity" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">A surge in military logistics and chartering to support operations congests regional ports, reallocates scarce tanker/charter capacity and raises scheduling/insurance frictions, reducing available commercial oil transport capacity on short notice.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">global_oil_market_shift</data>
</edge>
<edge source="russia_ukraine_war::military_supply_rate" target="iran_regional_conflict::kinetic_response_prob" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">Sustained increases in Western military shipments to Ukraine cause immediate depletion and reallocation of US/NATO precision munitions and rapid-fire stocks, reducing available ordnance for partners in the Middle East and thereby raising the likelihood that local actors or states will authorize kinetic options to achieve objectives before supplies run out or deterrence gaps widen.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_regional_conflict</data>
</edge>
<edge source="russia_ukraine_war::military_supply_rate" target="iran_regional_conflict::escalation_pressure" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Large-scale diversion of logistics and stockpiles to the Ukraine theater channels operational strain onto regional forces and logistics chains, increasing mobilization pressures, readiness shortfalls and incentives for preemptive or escalatory posturing in the Iran regional theater.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_regional_conflict</data>
</edge>
