  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Authorization of kinetic strikes that reveal weaponization pathways or supply-chain nodes for dual-use electronics incentivizes governments to widen and tighten export controls on advanced chips and related equipment to prevent further transfers.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
