  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Sustained declines in diesel export flows lower regime revenue and increase economic/political pressure on Tehran, which can raise incentives for risk-taking, proxy operations, or force-posturing that increase overall escalation pressure.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
