  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.75</data>
  <data key="d36">Higher diesel flows into the region improve fuel availability for transport and front‑line vehicles, sustaining operational mobility and allowing a higher rate of materiel and munitions deliveries to Ukrainian units.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">global_oil_market_shift</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
