  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.85</data>
  <data key="d36">Declining regional refinery utilization reduces the volume of available refined fuels in-market, directly increasing the probability of conflict-era fuel shortfalls and supply disruptions in the theatre.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">global_oil_market_shift</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_regional_conflict</data>
